im! \n\nFeel free to choose the outfit you would like to draw. Please note that Lazarus has tanned skin, uses purple eye shadow and has a long scar across his left cheek. These are his most striking features! Depending on the outfit, he may have odd eye colors as well (right eye is yellow, left eye is red). \n\nIf possible, I would like to see him smiling gently. You don't need to draw his weapons. Other specifics I leave up to you. Please draw freely, and have fun! ❤️\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QTp5STpG3Ocde2gdnBtpGPq52kI57D9e?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yamatori808/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1679277, "client_id": 937601, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/21129204/uploads/origins/6ed5bbe7-d6a2-4c70-9172-68f69bfff280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e45d6a91575d8d1dc4c268cad2ed909", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21129204/uploads/origins/6ed5bbe7-d6a2-4c70-9172-68f69bfff280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e45d6a91575d8d1dc4c268cad2ed909, https://si.imgix.net/21129204/uploads/origins/6ed5bbe7-d6a2-4c70-9172-68f69bfff280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34fe22fe4940764403c429832327bbc5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21129204/uploads/origins/6ed5bbe7-d6a2-4c70-9172-68f69bfff280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d35787a98d4a38ddce43953c224df732 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/21129204/uploads/origins/6ed5bbe7-d6a2-4c70-9172-68f69bfff280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5572051725ee6ea03e2a690f55bdcdf1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21129204/u